  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><ul><li data-start=\"135\" data-end=\"416\" id=\"isPasted\"><p data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"416\"><strong data-start=\"137\" data-end=\"170\">About our brand and products:</strong><br data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"173\">Balance Mate creates premium acupressure mats and pillows that help relieve back/neck pain, reduce stress, and improve sleep. Designed for daily 15–30 minute sessions, our sets are comfortable, durable, and look great at home or in the studio. Great for Yoga practitioners.&nbsp;</p></li><li data-start=\"418\" data-end=\"708\"><p data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"708\"><strong data-start=\"420\" data-end=\"448\">What makes us different:</strong><br data-start=\"448\" data-end=\"451\">Thoughtful ergonomics, skin-friendly materials, and a minimalist design available in two colors (Cream &amp; Deep Black). Every set includes a quick-start guide and routines for beginners to advanced users. Friendly, fast support and a customer-first guarantee.</p></li><li data-start=\"710\" data-end=\"970\"><p data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"970\"><strong data-start=\"712\" data-end=\"740\">How affiliates can earn:</strong><br data-start=\"740\" data-end=\"743\">Earn <strong data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"777\">[20%] commission per sale</strong> via tracked links or unique coupon codes. <strong data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"846\">[30-day] cookie window</strong>, <strong data-start=\"848\" data-end=\"868\" data-is-only-node=\"\">[tiered bonuses]</strong> for top performers, and regular creative refreshes. (Edit the bracketed numbers to your exact terms.)</p></li><li data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1238\"><p data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"1238\"><strong data-start=\"974\" data-end=\"996\">How to promote us:</strong><br data-start=\"996\" data-end=\"999\">Show quick routines (morning wind-down, post-workout recovery), pain-relief tips, yoga/Pilates integrations, and real user testimonials. Great for wellness blogs, TikTok/IG Reels, YouTube shorts, email newsletters, and studio partnerships.</p></li><li data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1456\"><p data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1456\"><strong data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1264\">Other information:</strong><br data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1267\">Target audience: adults seeking natural pain relief, better sleep, and recovery. Available on our website and select marketplaces. Media kit, copy, and product shots provided upon approval.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
